@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
# Copie SYNC_API_TOKEN do seu .env local
@token = coloque-o-token-aqui

### Saúde (pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Iniciar sync de professores
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-teachers-001

### Iniciar sync de alunos
POST {{baseUrl}}/sync/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Correlation-Id: demo-students-001

### Acompanhar execução
GET {{baseUrl}}/sync/demo-teachers-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Métricas do gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics